  "maid": "an unmarried girl; also a servant. The moon goddess Diana protects unmarried girls, so a virgin is 'the moon's maid'",
  "vestal": "virgin, as in the priestesses of Diana",
  "livery": "uniform worn by servants",
  "vestal livery": "the uniform of virginity that the moon gives her servants",
  "envious": "jealous",
  "that she knew she were": "that she knew she was (my love)",
  "sphere": "the orbit of a star or planet",
  "discourses": "speaks, communicates",
